th=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Portrait_Timmy.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">She makes a really good pot roast. Don't tell anyone I said this, but I actually think it might be better than mum's...</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Timmy</a> talking about Cora</div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>When approached, Timmy asks the interacting party member if they are an orphan too, and then responds by stating how much he misses his parents. \n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715021002\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.154 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.163 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4736/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 19376/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6322/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 25278/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.042/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1583495/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  153.160      1 -total\n 86.53%  132.525      1 Template:Infobox_creature\n 56.20%   86.077      1 Template:Infobox_creature/internal\n 23.69%   36.279      2 Template:Hidden_code\n  9.61%   14.715      1 Template:DiQ\n  9.25%   14.166      1 Template:Quote_fancy\n  9.1